    "created_at": "2015-12-03T19:53:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-03T19:53:47Z",
    "body": "`getImageData` is synchronous, `as` differentiates, which why I suggested it. Perhaps `createAsBlob` (or `createBlob`, if you will), which makes it sound not immediate (more than `get`).\nGenerally, `getFooBarBaz` is a good pattern for, well, getting stuff. :)\n\nBut I agree that Gecko should be on board with the idea first.\n",
