    "updated_at": "2015-12-03T20:08:40Z",
    "body": "[`MediaRecorder`](http://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-record/MediaRecorder.html#MediaRecorderAPI) produces `Blob` objects without having \"blob\" in any method names, so just `convert({ type: 'image/jpg', quality: 0.8 })` or some other verb like `encode` might be OK.\n",
